    <div class="page-shell">
      <p class="eyebrow">About / The human</p>
      <h1>Tinkerer. Shipper. <span class="hl">Loud.</span></h1>
      <p class="intro-copy">
        Between wild ideas and working software. Between lab coats and launch days. Between
        <strong>“what if”</strong> and <strong>“it’s live”</strong>.
      </p>
