  <section class="page-shell body-section">
    <p class="index">The short version</p>
    <div class="prose-big">
      <p>
        I used to wear the academic hats — lecturer, researcher, partnership wrangler. These days
        I spend that energy building: AI products, scrappy prototypes, and teams that ship.
      </p>
      <p>
        Different costumes, same question: how do we turn a complicated idea into something another
        person can understand, trust, and actually use?
      </p>
